" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M280 95h130\" stroke=\"#747c70\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M280 99h130\" stroke=\"#747c70\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M280 103h130\" stroke=\"#747c70\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M280 107h130\" stroke=\"#747c70\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M280 111h130\" stroke=\"#747c70\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"162\">泥岩教学外观：层状</text><ellipse cx=\"585\" cy=\"88\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#b4b4a2\"/><text x=\"520\" y=\"162\">灰岩教学外观：云斑</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"200\">演示修改真实RGB像素，再重新分割、提特征和预测；图像不等于矿物测量。</text></g></svg></div></div><figcaption>三类只是合成外观教学标签，色域允许重叠；参考片校正的收益与纹理特征的收益要分开理解。</figcaption></figure>"
